    "text": "import math\n\n\ndef lowest(a, key=abs):\n    best, low = 0, math.inf\n    for i in range(len(a)):\n        if key(a[i]) < low:\n            best, low = i, key(a[i])\n    return best\n\n\ndef front(a, log):\n    m = lowest(a)\n    a[0], a[m] = a[m], a[0]\n    log.append(m)\n    return a\n",
    "entry": "front([3, -1], [])"
